# Credentials. The README tells you to authenticate Earth Engine with a Google
# service-account key and never to commit it; nothing here enforced that, so a
# key dropped into the working tree was one `git add .` away from the remote.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*-key.json
*credentials*.json
service-account*.json
gcloud-*.json
